# Any alternate agent home, not just the default one. KNOWME_HOME can point anywhere.
# Without this glob only `.knowme/` was covered, so a second home's SOUL.md,
# usage.jsonl and outbox/ were tracked — the exact files you least want pushed.
.knowme-*/
.env.prerename-bak

# Delegated coding deliverables (dated run folders + auto-run logs)
knowme_workspace/

# Google OAuth: the client file you download from Cloud Console, and any token
# it produces. Nothing here should ever be committed — belt and braces, because
# the docs used to tell people to drop credentials.json in the repo root.
credentials.json
client_secret*.json
*token*.json
.gcp/

.knowme
.knowme-arena

scripts
read.md
examples/*
.claude
Claude.md
AGENTS.md

# 只匹配仓库根目录那个 images/。以前这里是裸的 `images`，**任意层级**同名都匹配，
# 于是 docs/images/ 也被一起吃掉了——README 里的截图放进去、`git add` 一声不响地跳过，
# 网页上就是一个裂图。根目录那个 images/ 是**另一个产品**的截图，本来就不该进库。
/images/

# evals/ 现在整个进库。以前这里有一行 `evals/*`，结果是硬盘上 100 个文件里
# 只有 46 个被 -f 强制加进来：别人 clone 下来 `make eval` 连 conftest.py 都找不到，
# 一半测试根本不存在。（sql/ 同理：Supabase 的建表 SQL 得进库，升级路才是通的。）
# 注意 `__pycache__/` 在第一行已经挡住了，不用管。

# ---- 开发过程产物：本地留着，但不进公开仓库 ----------------------------
# 这些回答的是"当时怎么想、怎么一步步做出来的"，是过程不是产品，
# 公开仓库里不该出现。用 `git rm --cached` 移出去不会删本地文件。
CURRENT_PROGRESS.md
IMPLEMENTATION_COMPLETE.md
